 "key_sub": "負數有偶數個，積是正；奇數個，積是負。",
 "body_html": "<h2>怎麼想</h2><p><b>同號相乘除得正，異號相乘除得負</b>：（－3）×（－4）＝ 12，（－12）÷ 3 ＝ －4。</p><p>很多個數相乘：負數有<b>偶數個</b>，積是正；有<b>奇數個</b>，積是負。有 0 就是 0。</p><p>除以一個數等於乘以它的倒數；0 不能當除數。</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>（－2）×（－3）×（－5）</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>負數有 3 個，答案是負。</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>2 × 3 × 5 ＝ 30。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：－30</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>（－<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>4</span></span>）÷ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>2</span></span></p><p class='sn-ex-s'>乘以倒數 2。</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>異號得負。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：－<span class='fr'><span class='fn'>3</span><span class='fd'>2</span></span></p></div><h2>常見錯誤</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常見錯誤</th><th>正確的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>（－3）×（－4）＝ －12</td><td>同號相乘得正：12</td></tr><tr><td>（－1）×（－1）×（－1）＝ 1</td><td>負數 3 個（奇數），答案是 －1</td></tr><tr><td>÷ <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>2</span></span> 直接乘 <span class='fr'><span class='fn'>1</span><span class='fd'>2</span></span></td><td>要乘以倒數 2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
